        <head>EARLESTOWN CRICKET CLUB.</head>
        <p>EARLESTOWN CRICKET CLUB.</p>
        <p>The following are the doings for the season of the Earlestown Cricket Club. The Ist eleven have played 19 matches, won 8, lost 7, drawn 4, scoring 2620 for 162 wickets, average 1623. Opponents scored 2621 for 171 wickets, average 1532. Second eleven played 22 matches, winning 13, losing 7, drawing 2. AVERAGES FOtt 1904.</p>
