        <head>GUARDIANS' ELECTION.</head>
        <p>GUARDIANS' ELECTION.</p>
        <p>An election took place on Mond;:;;.-in the Viaduct ward of Newton-in-Makerfield, to fill the vacancy on the Warrington Board of Guardians, caused by the death of Mr. John Clark. Mr. William Matthew Seaton, commission agent, was returne.d at the head of the poll with 310, whilst Mr. Nathaniel Siddeley, gentleman, polled 154, and Mr. Astley King, ironmonger,polled 137</p>
