        <p>The following have batted in less than 5 complete innings W. Turton B. Taylor 3 ... 0 ... 17 ... 29 P. Bailey W. Bell 2 ... 0 ... 6 ... 8 ... W. Gorst P. Bladen R. Hewitt G. Morrall G. Gough J. Pritchard SL Partridge W. Jones E. Searle</p>
