      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1904-09-17_WidnesExaminer_art0139" n="art0139">
        <head>BOWLING.</head>
        <p>BOWLING.</p>
        <p>Overs. Mds. Runs. Wks. Avge. A. Gleave 9O ... 18 ... 222 ... 35 ... 634 R. Cook 129 ... 20 ... 329 ... 39 ... 8.43 H.Brough C. Llewellyn N.Cook 49 ... 10 ... 124 ... 10 ... 12.40 F. Burton 2l ... 3 ... 81 ... 3 ... 27.00</p>
